The way I use blessed scrolls of identify to get maximum benefit is very
simple and takes only a little effort. Drop all the things you want to
identify in a pile. Move one space and drop all the other things of the
same classes in another pile. Pick up your first (unidentified object)
pile and read your scroll of identify. Select the object classes in
order of importance. Doing it this way ensures every object identified
is one you want to identify, and in order of priority.

